  "notes": "The target 'Avg_Mort' (average annual probability of death) is unavailable. The document does not publish a mortality table (q_x) or sample mortality rates. Exhibit XI.1 (Page 69) publishes 'Disability Rates' (probability of becoming disabled), which are distinct from mortality rates. The text references RP-2014 mortality tables with scaling factors but does not provide the underlying sample rates or a table of probabilities of death. The transcribed tables (Exhibit B.1 and D.1) provide member counts by age for active and service-retired members, which could serve as weights, but there is no mortality rate data to blend. The document also does not publish pre-retirement or post-retirement mortality rates by age. Therefore, the target cannot be constructed."
